scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirit is no longer a broad 'Ephemera' Arcanum since every Arcana can have its own frequency of Twilight now</div> </div> </div> </div>It <i>is</i>, however, the Arcanum you use to deal with Essence.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-07T10:56:39-08:00","id":1045222,"title":"","content":"I *like* the idea of mages not being able to see Angels in Twilight. Goes a long way to explaining why they aren't worried about the GM or Infrastructure etc. In my game, the Pentacle's like<br /> <br /> &quot;The God-Machine? What? Sounds like a minor Paternoster ochema or something. If we can't see it, it mustn't exist. We're mages: we see EVERYTHING. Whatevs.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11153-bonerstorm","name":"bonerstorm","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-07T16:44:02-08:00","id":1045484,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted b